        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium composite panel, at regional storage, with resource correction
Alu-Verbund-Fassadenplatte, Regionallager CH\nMarktmix aus Platten mit flammgeschütztem und nicht flammgeschütztem Kern. Resource correction added for share of primary aluminium for KBOB recommendation 2016.\nMittlere Plattendicke 4 mm, Mittleres Flächengewicht 7.1 kg/m2, \nAludeckschichten 2.7 kg/m2, Kern 4.4 kg/m2\nVersion: 0.0\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: construction materials\nLocal subcategory: Alu-Verbundplatten\nUVEK 2022 source file:process_7d8de774-74fd-475a-8a70-46ea1e6ab572.xml\n\n
